From: Security Patch
Subject: Fix CVE-2021-25646: JavaScript RCE vulnerability via empty key bypass

This patch fixes a Remote Code Execution vulnerability in Apache Druid 0.20.0
where attackers could bypass JavaScript security settings by using an empty
key "" in JSON payloads to override the injected JavaScriptConfig.

The fix adds useInput = OptBoolean.FALSE to all @JacksonInject annotations
for JavaScriptConfig to prevent JSON input from overriding the injected
configuration values.

